# Public HTTPS termination for the leitwerk UI/API.
#
# Caddy obtains and renews Let's Encrypt certificates automatically and reverse
# proxies to the server on the shared private `leitwerk` network. The server
# HTTP API is not published directly.
#
# Replace leitwerk.example.com with your public hostname. For local testing,
# use `localhost` (Caddy issues an internal cert) and reach it over https.

leitwerk.example.com {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy leitwerk-server:8080
}
